  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Digital and Remote Access School Instruction (DARASI): Accelerated Foundational Literacy &amp; Numeracy for Out-of-School Children in Kano State</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The DARASI Programme delivers accelerated foundational education to out-of-school children in rural Kano State through a community-led, radio-supported model aligned with ABEP Level 1.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This four-month pilot demonstrates the feasibility and scalability of delivering ABEP Level 1 to underserved children, generating evidence for national scale-up.</narrative>
  </description>
